---
/**
 * The two lines under every piece: who wrote it, what she does, and what she is
 * open to. Growth Plan action 1.2.
 *
 * Speaking is in the list on purpose. Growth Plan 3.2 (book two podcasts or
 * guest slots per quarter) calls itself the most-skipped action in the plan,
 * and an essay reaches the people who programme events, so this is the one
 * place the ask costs nothing to make. /keynote-speaker/ is the booking
 * page; /speaking/ is the archive of past talks and is not linked here.
 *
 * It exists because an essay can be someone's first contact with Saielle and,
 * until now, ended without ever saying who wrote it or that she is available.
 * Third person on purpose: the essay above it is first person, and the switch
 * is what marks this as the credential block rather than more of the piece.
 *
 * One component, used by both the beehiiv and the local-essay branches of
 * /writing/[slug], so the bio cannot drift between them.
 */
---

<aside class="author-bio" aria-label="About the author">
  <img
    class="author-bio-portrait"
    src="/saielle-dasilva.jpg"
    alt=""
    width="72"
    height="72"
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
  />
  <p class="author-bio-text">
    <strong>Saielle DaSilva</strong> is a fractional product leader and
    forward-deployed builder. She helps teams work out what to build, then stays
    and builds it with them.
    <br />
    <span class="author-bio-open"
      >Currently open to <a href="/fractional/">fractional product leadership</a>,
      <a href="/forward-deployed/">embedded build work</a> and
      <a href="/keynote-speaker/">speaking</a>.</span
    >
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .author-bio {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
    /* Hairline block: vertical inset only, matching .signup below, so the bio
       stays aligned to the text column rather than indenting away from it. */
    padding-block: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--slate);
  }

  .author-bio-portrait {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .author-bio-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .author-bio-text strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .author-bio-open {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .author-bio {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-3);
    }
  }
</style>
